# Pairs with ScopelessFromClusterWideOnly: the tenant layer governs a tenant's capability id and keeps a tenant Telemetry rule, so a tenant-layer rule confers Telemetry.

MODULE: TenantLayerGovernsCapability
TARGET: ScopelessFromClusterWideOnly
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the tenant layer governs a tenant's capability id and keeps a tenant Telemetry rule, so a tenant-layer rule confers Telemetry

--- FIND
TenantLayerTree(tree) == tree.kind = "tenant"
--- REPLACE
TenantLayerTree(tree) == tree.kind \in {"tenant", "tenantCapability"}
--- END
--- FIND
    /\ r.ops \subseteq TenantOps
--- REPLACE
    /\ r.ops \subseteq Ops
--- END
--- FIND
       \/ r.tree.kind = "tenant" /\ r.tree.tenant = r.owner
--- REPLACE
       \/ r.tree.kind \in {"tenant", "tenantCapability"} /\ r.tree.tenant = r.owner
--- END
